OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers through the evening. Cloud
OL,7,Fbreaking at times through the night
OL,8,Fand turning chilly under any prolonged
OL,9,Fclear spells that develop. Brisk winds
OL,10,Faround the coast but lighter inland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA partly cloudy day with
OL,13,Fisolated showers possible but some
OL,14,Fgood sunny spells as well. Feeling
OL,15,Fcool in fresh easterly winds,
OL,16,Fparticularly around the coasts.
